        "chapter": 33,
        "verse": 15
      },
      {
        "text": "In those days shall Judah be saved, and Jerusalem shall dwell safely: and this is the name wherewith she shall be called, The Lord our righteousness.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 79,
            "end": 90
