        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Jeremiah 33:20",
        "book": "Jeremiah",
        "chapter": 33,
        "verse": 20
      },
      {
        "text": "Then may also my covenant be broken with David my servant, that he should not have a son to reign upon his throne; and with the Levites the priests, my ministers.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 0,
            "end": 4
          }
