        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 21,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Jeremiah 33:21",
        "book": "Jeremiah",
        "chapter": 33,
        "verse": 21
      },
      {
        "text": "As the host of heaven cannot be numbered, neither the sand of the sea measured: so will I multiply the seed of David my servant, and the Levites that minister unto me.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 22,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Jeremiah 33:22",
        "book": "Jeremiah",
        "chapter": 33,
        "verse": 22
      },
      {
        "text": "Moreover the word of the Lord came to Jeremiah, saying,",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 23,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Jeremiah 33:23",
        "book": "Jeremiah",
        "chapter": 33,
        "verse": 23
      },
      {
        "text": "Considerest thou not what this people have spoken, saying, The two families which the Lord hath chosen, he hath even cast them off? thus they have despised my people, that they should be no more a nation before them.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 24,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Jeremiah 33:24",
        "book": "Jeremiah",
        "chapter": 33,
        "verse": 24
      },
      {
        "text": "Thus saith the Lord; If my covenant be not with day and night, and if I have not appointed the ordinances of heaven and earth;",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 36,
            "end": 38
          },
          {
            "start": 63,
            "end": 69
